{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04302","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 张昌宗","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云车遥裔三珠树，帐殿交阴八桂丛。\n磵险泉声疑度雨，川平桥势若晴虹。\n叔夜弹琴歌白雪，孙登长啸韵清风。\n即此陪欢游阆苑，无劳辛苦向崆峒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昌宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}